🎮 And we must preserve what makes this game special

Ryyon, the Guardian’s personality is one of the strongest parts of this concept.

He’s not an invincible hero who knows everything. He’s an ordinary, overwhelmed character who has somehow ended up in a world full of things that want to kill him.

His reactions make the adventure entertaining.

Imagine this sequence:

The Guardian discovers a terrifying monster.

GUARDIAN: “Okay. Nobody panic.”

COMPANION: “You’re panicking.”

