We don’t need all seven components fully developed before we begin. We can build and test them incrementally.

The big idea is that the first level serves two purposes: it’s a game people can enjoy, and it’s a demonstration of what the community can create together.

And that is what I’d want people to understand when they encounter Freedom World for the first time:

